  "releaseNotes": "[Add] DerivedPropertyAttribute and OperationAttribute decorate every generated Extend method, distinguishing a derived property from an operation (#211)\n            [Add] PSM DTOs, interfaces and enumerations generated from the Systems Modeling API and Services OpenAPI document (#367, #371)\n            [Add] ModelLevelEvaluableFunctions exposes the Kernel Functions Library membership set backing Function::isModelLevelEvaluable (#364)\n            [Update] IData splits into IIdentified and IDataRequest, separating what carries an identifier from what may be sent without one (#371)\n            [Fix] Build warnings reduced; generated files carry an auto-generated marker so analyzers skip them (#280)",
